// fail-closed BOTH directions: `csv_parse : String -> Outcome<CsvDocument>`
// AND **`csv_emit : CsvDocument -> Outcome<String>`** (with dialect
// supplied as an explicit parameter — the CSV surface is NOT pure
// `String -> …` like JSON; the ratified `Outcome<T>` carrier is still the
