// receipt PR #3181)). **D2** resolver shape is ratified #3195 — reference
// freely; do not mint parallel result carriers. Operations deferred-with-
// named-owner. (Single authority = the Deferred (1) block below.)
//
// L-2 VERSION PIN (C5 / extdeps discipline): RFC 4180 is the normative
