// brief msg_0bbc95f3): whether CSV is modeled as a fixed-arity rectangular
// table vs ragged rows, how `width` / `Row` / header interact, and what
// parse/emit MUST do, is **operator-pending** — this worker does NOT pick a
// disposition, does NOT describe a ratified parse policy here, and does NOT
