// CARRIER SEAM — fail-closed BOTH directions (authority = Deferred (1)):
//   - `csv_parse : (source: String, dialect: CsvDialect) -> Outcome<CsvDocument>`
//   - `csv_emit  : (doc: CsvDocument, dialect: CsvDialect) -> Outcome<String>`
// Immutable scaffold header's `parse(String, Dialect) -> Result<…>` /
// `emit(CsvDocument, Dialect) -> String` lines: the `Result<…, Diagnostic>`
// prose denotes `Outcome<…>` per DECISIONS **I**; the `-> String` emit line
// is the superseded total-emit shape — operator-tier header-reconcile
// (csv-class; tracked-not-silent in Deferred (1)), same json.dag #3184
// finding.
