// for semantic presence). The immutable header's `Option<…>` spelling is the
// conceptual contract; the mechanical carrier below is the reconciled explicit
// form pending a literal header edit batch.
//
// `Bool`/`String` kernel-ambient; `List`/`Map` kernel containers (STRUCTURE.
// md). `Nat`/`Char` are imported where needed for future substrate edges
